OL,3,GNEWSAPolice get #450k to target knife
OL,4,Acrime hotspots
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have been given more than
OL,7,F#450,000 to help prevent knife crime in
OL,8,Fproblem areas of Nottinghamshire.
OL,10,FEight locations have been identified
OL,11,Ffor the funding including the
OL,12,FBroadmarsh, Old Market Square and
OL,13,FVictoria Centre areas in Nottingham
OL,14,Fcity centre, as well as Hucknall,
OL,15,FBeeston, Mansfield town centre, the
OL,16,FRavensdale area of Mansfield and
OL,17,FSutton-in-Ashfield.
OL,19,FThe money has been supplied by the Home
OL,20,FOffice, having been secured by
OL,21,FNottinghamshire's Violence Reduction
OL,22,FPartnership.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
