OL,3,GNEWSAPolice get #450k to target knife
OL,4,Acrime hotspots
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt will pay for extra patrols,
OL,7,Fincreased CCTV coverage and early
OL,8,Fintervention work in areas identified
OL,9,Fas having the highest volume of knife
OL,10,Fcrime-related incidents over the past
OL,11,Fthree years.
